  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: start;\">00교육청 논술형 평가 사례나눔 다녀왔습니다.<br>&#160;<br>평가문항 제작 및 분석 실습을 넣었습니다.<br>&#160;<br>평가문항은<br>선생님들이 준비하시면 부담스러워,<br>제가 실제로 정기고사에 출제했던 서/논술형 문항 5개를&#160;<br>실습용 예시자료로 준비했습니다.<br>&#160;<br>또한 평가문항 분석도 중요하지만<br>문항의 배경이 되는 해당 &#39;수업&#39;을 마이크로티칭을 하면 좋겠다는 생각을 했습니다.<br>(교수평 일체화 차원)<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;연수 진행 과정&gt;</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>1. 왜 논술형 평가인가? - 이론적 배경 설명</b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/5336efe0de3febdf49580474e2a3294072cf8848\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/5336efe0de3febdf49580474e2a3294072cf8848\" data-origin-width=\"953\" data-origin-height=\"674\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/d4384827e729343b22922453d2333aad71efb1b4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/d4384827e729343b22922453d2333aad71efb1b4\" data-origin-width=\"949\" data-origin-height=\"687\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/94f8ca264a10ef229598521bbdf1ad3b6e2ad154\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/94f8ca264a10ef229598521bbdf1ad3b6e2ad154\" data-origin-width=\"964\" data-origin-height=\"708\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/61c6637470430c3ea7361aa74953958bea3af2f2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/61c6637470430c3ea7361aa74953958bea3af2f2\" data-origin-width=\"978\" data-origin-height=\"705\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/816616d611adc6bd77731d49355e0ebd2fbd0888\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/816616d611adc6bd77731d49355e0ebd2fbd0888\" data-origin-width=\"968\" data-origin-height=\"442\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;<br><b>2. 마이크로 티칭(수업 시연)&#160;</b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/3ad3bdca4d1b94b1c7d895d043d01bfe1d49e3cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/3ad3bdca4d1b94b1c7d895d043d01bfe1d49e3cb\" data-origin-width=\"914\" data-origin-height=\"633\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/c7c9bb2a3f97d66bff3d772c130f293ddf6897c4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/c7c9bb2a3f97d66bff3d772c130f293ddf6897c4\" data-origin-width=\"957\" data-origin-height=\"725\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/0902949f7e18eea5003e3b06fbef1ed16f05deb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/0902949f7e18eea5003e3b06fbef1ed16f05deb4\" data-origin-width=\"792\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/5ab602584c688e2b41f4c3f4ecf25ec8d2428900\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/5ab602584c688e2b41f4c3f4ecf25ec8d2428900\" data-origin-width=\"907\" data-origin-height=\"507\"></div>교수평 일체화의 차원에서<br>이런 수업(탐구활동)을&#160;<br>지필평가 논술형평가로 연계한다면?</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;<br><b>3. 해당 수업과 연계한 논술형 평가문항에 대한 논의</b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/95b80c8a5e3803adf6c3218b228af18d08d42f24\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/95b80c8a5e3803adf6c3218b228af18d08d42f24\" data-origin-width=\"495\" data-origin-height=\"629\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/7069b492d0b80fb6ae289ae8c66fb3d47ba0e18e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/7069b492d0b80fb6ae289ae8c66fb3d47ba0e18e\" data-origin-width=\"624\" data-origin-height=\"286\"></div>활동 : 채점 기준표(인정답안, 부분점수 인정답안)<br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 함께 만들기<br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;<br><b>4. 논술형 문항 제작 실습 및 채점기준표 작성</b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/484643b039c4d8e6cc20e43d8dcfa1b6fc6be05e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/484643b039c4d8e6cc20e43d8dcfa1b6fc6be05e\" data-origin-width=\"575\" data-origin-height=\"680\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/1039bae682649eace4e3f092d7c93fe8f1597e9d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/1039bae682649eace4e3f092d7c93fe8f1597e9d\" data-origin-width=\"549\" data-origin-height=\"474\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;<br><b>5. 서/논술형 문항 컨설팅</b><br>&#160; &#160;강사가 평가문항 &#39;의뢰자&#39;가 되고,<br>&#160; &#160;연수 참가 선생님들이 &#39;컨설턴트&#39;가 되어 의견 나누기</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
